### 1. Create a task
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Express",
  "priority": "high"
}

### 2. Create without title (should fail)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "no title"
}

### 3. Get all tasks
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks

### 4. Filter by status
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks?status=pending

### 5. Get one task (replace PASTE_ID)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/6ae1054d7370d85bf749f38c

### 6. Update a task
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/6ae1054d7370d85bf749f38c
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "completed"
}

### 7. Invalid status (should fail)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/6ae1054d7370d85bf749f38c
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "banana"
}

### 8. Delete a task
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/6ae1054d7370d85bf749f38c